  "ai_detect_title": "The AI sees what you may not",
  "ai_detect_subtitle": "Every trade hides a pattern. TradeDiscipline identifies them, classifies them, and explains how to fix them.",
  "ai_detect_1": "You trade too often after a loss: revenge trading is costing you",
